7]] ventilando ut faces. Visionum illa et Chiliasmi mentio multum noceat bonis alioqui\n[[525.8]] viris, quod judicarent qui rebus praesunt, non tuto talibus imbui vulgus. </p>\n","number":"147.","title":"LEIBNIZ AN VEIT LUDWIG VON SECKENDORFF","date":"[Hannover,] 24. April (4. Mai) 1692. [134.163.]"}
      </script>

      <!-- Detailed scholarly view with line numbers -->
